        </div>
        <div class="pv-rows">
          <div class="pv-row">
            <div class="pv-stock"><b>騰訊控股</b><span>00700</span></div>
            <div class="pv-tag up">短線偏強 ▲</div>
            <div class="pv-lock"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>入場/止蝕</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pv-row">
            <div class="pv-stock"><b>比亞迪股份</b><span>01211</span></div>
            <div class="pv-tag up">資金流入 ▲</div>
            <div class="pv-lock"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>入場/止蝕</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pv-row blur">
            <div class="pv-stock"><b>●●●●</b><span>0●●●●</span></div>
            <div class="pv-tag up">●●●● ▲</div>
            <div class="pv-lock">●●●●</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-foot">仲有 <b id="pvMore">3</b> 隻今日精選股，加 WhatsApp 即刻睇晒</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ 屏 3 · 社會證明 + CTA ═══════════ -->
    <section class="proof">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow-txt">Real users</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">超過 <span class="grad">12,000</span> 位港股股民<br />每朝跟住 AI 揀股</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="reviews">
        <div class="review reveal">
          <div class="rv-stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>「以前自己睇圖睇到頭都大，而家每朝 WhatsApp 收到精選同訊號，慳返好多時間，入場止蝕都唔使自己估。」</p>
          <div class="rv-by"><span class="rv-av">陳</span><div><b>陳生</b><i>跟咗 3 個月</i></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="review reveal">
          <div class="rv-stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>「最啱我哋打工仔，唔使成日睇住個市。盤前收到，跟住入場目標位做，清清楚楚。」</p>
          <div class="rv-by"><span class="rv-av">M</span><div><b>Mandy</b><i>跟咗 1 個月</i></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="review reveal">
          <div class="rv-stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>「訊號夠清晰，入場、目標、止蝕都寫到明，唔似坊間啲貼士群淨係嗌你買。」</p>
          <div class="rv-by"><span class="rv-av">黃</span><div><b>黃小姐</b><i>跟咗 5 個月</i></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="steps reveal">
